[
  {
    "type": "hero",
    "data": {
      "label": "About",
      "heading": "One developer, from the *first call* to handover.",
      "subtext": "I am a web developer in the UK. I build Laravel applications and WordPress sites, add AI where it earns its keep, and run Kritano, the website auditing platform I founded. The person you talk to is the person who writes the code.",
      "cta_label": "Start a project",
      "cta_url": "/contact",
      "cta_secondary_label": "See the work",
      "cta_secondary_url": "/work",
      "theme": "light"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "text-section",
    "data": {
      "label": "Who I am",
      "heading": "A developer who builds the whole thing.",
      "theme": "light",
      "body": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Most of my career has been building web platforms: Astro, Next.js, Node.js, Postgres and Redis, the kind of work where you have to ship something that holds up under real load. Today I build in "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Laravel",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "attrs": {
                      "href": "/services/laravel"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " and "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "WordPress",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "attrs": {
                      "href": "/services/wordpress"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ". I started doing "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "AI work",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "attrs": {
                      "href": "/services/ai"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " in 2023, because the APIs got good enough to be the missing piece in a lot of the systems I was already building."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When I say I will integrate something with your CRM or your accounting tool, I mean I will build it. Not specify it for someone else, not draw it on a slide. Build it, ship it, monitor it, and fix it if it breaks."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I also build my own products. "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Kritano",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "attrs": {
                      "href": "/work/kritano-website-audits"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " audits websites against more than 500 rules, and this site runs on "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "cg-cms",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "attrs": {
                      "href": "/work/cg-cms"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", a CMS I wrote for Laravel. Both shape how I work for clients: I know what good looks like, because I check for it every day."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "text-section",
    "data": {
      "label": "Why one person",
      "heading": "The one-person model is the feature, not the limitation.",
      "theme": "light",
      "body": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Agencies tend to run on the same shape: a senior person sells, a project manager translates, a junior delivers. By the time the work lands, three people have stood between you and the person who built it."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When you work with me, the person scoping the work is the person doing it. That has practical effects:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Faster decisions.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " If a build choice needs your input, I ask you directly."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Direct access.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " Ask me about something the system is doing and I will answer it, in technical detail if you want it."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Fewer places for quality to leak.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " One person writing the system means it is consistent from end to end."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What you do not get is a 24/7 support desk or a team of twelve specialisms. If you need those, you need an agency. For everything else, one person is faster and cleaner."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "text-section",
    "data": {
      "label": "How I work",
      "heading": "Four steps, no theatre.",
      "theme": "light",
      "body": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "orderedList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Look.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " I start with what you have: the site, the code, the process. For a website, that usually means an audit, so the work goes where it makes a difference."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Scope.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " We agree what to build first, and I write it down: what it does, what done looks like, and how long it should take."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Build.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " Direct work, with tests, and you can ask me anything at any point. No status meetings for the sake of them."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Hand over.",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "bold"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " Deployed, documented and yours. Then we look at what changed and decide whether there is a next step."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
